d 'GRANGERSPEC': module to conduct Granger causality tests across frequencies: Granger-causality spectra 
d
d    grangerspec tests for Granger causality at different
d frequencies, so that Granger causality at low (business-cycle)
d and high frequencies can be distinguished. It estimates the
d Granger-causality spectrum, which shows how strongly one series
d helps predict another at each frequency, in unconditional form
d and conditional on a third variable, and tests its significance
d with the bootstrap method of Farne & Montanari (2022,
d Computational Economics). A further test shows whether the
d causality between the two series changes once the third variable
d is taken into account, and the parametric Breitung & Candelon
d (2006) F test is included as a complement. 
d
d KW: Granger causality
d KW: frequency domain
d KW: spectrum
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260805
d
d Author: Ozan Eruygur,  Ankara Haci Bayram Veli University
d Support: email eruygur@@gmail.com
d
